[size=4][b]Description[/b][/size]
Typing no longer stops when you switch the keyboard layout.

In vanilla Valheim, switching the keyboard layout while typing (Alt+Shift, Win+Space, Ctrl+Space, Caps Lock or any other hotkey) drops the text field you're typing in: the next keys go to the game instead, and you have to click the field again. It happens everywhere:
[list]
[*]chat and the F5 console
[*]map pin names
[*]sign and portal texts
[*]the build menu (hammer) search
[*]the crafting search of mods like Workbenches+
[*]any other mod's text field
[/list]
This mod fixes the cause, so the field simply keeps focus and you keep typing in the new layout.

[b]Using [url=https://thunderstore.io/c/valheim/p/MidnightMods/ValheimCommunityPatch/]Valheim Community Patch[/url]?[/b] You don't need this mod: it was merged into Valheim Community Patch in version 0.42.0 and is on by default there ([font=Courier New]Fix Layout Switch Focus[/font]).

[size=4][b]What's going on[/b][/size]
A layout switch makes Unity's Input System report a keyboard [i]configuration change[/i]. Valheim treats every such change as a switch between keyboard and gamepad, and the build menu answers it by clearing the UI selection, which takes keyboard focus away from whatever field you're in. The mod lets the build menu do everything it did except that, and only while you're typing with the keyboard. Switching to a gamepad behaves as before.

[size=4][b]Notes[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Client-side only[/b]: nothing on the server, safe in multiplayer.
[*]No per-frame work: one patch on a game method that runs only when the layout changes.
[*]Tested on Windows and macOS. On Linux it does the same if the game sees layout switches there; otherwise there's nothing to fix.
[*]Works alongside ConsoleFix and other input mods.
[*]Config [font=Courier New]BepInEx/config/rgeraskin.LayoutSwitchFocusFix.cfg[/font]: [b]Enabled[/b], and [b]Debug.Log[/b] to log layout changes and every focus loss with its cause (helps with bug reports).
[/list]

[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]
Needs [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/valheim/mods/3605]BepInExPack Valheim[/url]. Install with Vortex, or unpack the archive into the game folder: the plugin goes to [font=Courier New]BepInEx/plugins/LayoutSwitchFocusFix/[/font].

[size=4][b]Bugs and ideas[/b][/size]
Found a bug or have an idea? Tell me on the [url=https://github.com/rgeraskin/valheim-layout-switch-focus-fix/issues]GitHub issues page[/url] or in the chat for my mods, on [url=https://discord.gg/hxpuTQF2Bb]Discord[/url] or [url=https://t.me/+NwReoOS9x7hhYjgy]Telegram[/url].

[size=4][b]Made with AI[/b][/size]
